          "content": "Activity 8.11: Let us understand the process"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.116,
            0.746,
            0.179
          ],
          "content": "Label Fig. 8.9 using arrows shown and the words given in the box to show where water is stored, how water changes its state and where it moves."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.141,
